    "sections": {
        "description": "The Fitness Instructor theme is designed for trainers, coaches, gyms, and wellness professionals who want to present their services clearly on a structured website. It supports use cases such as personal trainer websites, fitness coach portfolios, gym training programs, and online workout classes. The layout focuses on organizing essential information like training schedules, instructor profiles, workout programs, and client testimonials. This fitness instructor theme offers flexible sections that help highlight health coaching services, yoga instructor pages, and fitness studio information without a complex setup. Users can create pages for workout plans, nutrition guidance, and training sessions, making it suitable for both individual trainers and small fitness centers. With clean design elements and organized content blocks, the theme helps build a practical fitness training website where visitors can easily explore services, schedules, and instructor details."
    },
